# No environment variables required for the demo.
# The app runs entirely in-memory with pre-seeded data.
#
# In a production deployment you would configure:
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:port/dbname
# SESSION_SECRET=your-random-secret-key
# IMEI_API_KEY=your-imei-api-key
# DO_SPACES_ACCESS_KEY=your-spaces-key
# DO_SPACES_SECRET_KEY=your-spaces-secret
